Ruby 4.0 is the only Ruby: port the sary binding to it instead of
pinning Ruby 3.3 (patch-builder.c, patch-searcher.c), and let the sary
tool build with clang and GCC 14 and later (patch-src_sary.c).
Not submitted upstream.

